======

| Project                         | Recommended LLM                                                                                               |
| ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Bus Information Chatbot         | **Gemini** (good free tier for development)                                                                   |
| Restaurant Ordering Chatbot     | **Gemini** or **OpenAI**                                                                                      |
| Watch Shop PDF Chatbot          | **Gemini** with RAG                                                                                           |
| Enterprise Bus Booking Platform | **OpenAI** or a **self-hosted Llama** deployment, depending on cost, privacy, and infrastructure requirements |


======

OpenAI: Best choice when you need high performance and are comfortable using a paid cloud API.
Gemini: Great for learning, prototyping, and multimodal applications, with a useful free tier.
Llama: Best when you need to self-host the model for privacy, customization, or offline operation.

